  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "This dwarf dense bush has small, very thick, shiny, evergreen leaves. The lobes are short, rounded, and blunt-tipped. The new leaves are an attractive red-brown, becoming green for the summer, before turning yellow to orange in the fall. The name means \"palace. \""
